# @kisaesdevlab/* (single sign-on, docs/sso.md) is published to GitHub Packages, which needs a
# token even for reads. The token is NEVER written here: put
#   //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=<PAT with read:packages>
# in your user-level ~/.npmrc, or export NODE_AUTH_TOKEN=$(gh auth token) for a one-off.
@kisaesdevlab:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
